      "text": "A PRISMA flow diagram of search and screening with two parallel streams. The systematic search found 3 records, all reviewed in full text and excluded for wrong method, leaving 0 eligible records. The open, hand and expert search found 27 records, excluded for wrong method or being out of scope, leaving 0 eligible records.",
